{{!-- Ночные часы: вкладки «Сейчас» (циферблат ночи), «Ход времени» и «Хроника и город». Корень — <form>. --}}
<div class="r-cal" data-cal-phase data-phase="{{phase.key}}">
  <nav class="r-cal-tabs">
    {{#each tabs as |t|}}<a class="{{#if t.active}}is-active{{/if}}" data-action="calTab" data-tab="{{t.id}}">{{t.label}}</a>{{/each}}
  </nav>

  {{#if tabNow}}
  <div class="r-cal-now">
    <div class="r-cal-dial" data-cal-dial>{{{dial}}}</div>
    <div class="r-cal-meta">
      {{#if republic}}<b class="r-cal-republic">{{republic}}</b>{{/if}}
      <span><span data-cal-date>{{longDate}}</span> · <span data-cal-sub>{{weekday}} · {{phase.label}}</span></span>
      <span>{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.NightN"}} <b data-cal-night>{{night}}</b> · {{moon.glyph}} {{moon.label}}, {{moon.illumination}}%</span>
      <span class="r-cal-sun"><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"></i> {{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Sunset"}} {{sunset}} · <i class="fa-solid fa-sun"></i> {{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Sunrise"}} {{sunrise}}</span>
      {{#if nightNote}}<span class="r-cal-tonight"><i class="fa-solid fa-feather"></i> {{nightNote}}</span>{{/if}}
    </div>
    <div class="r-cal-quick">
      <a class="r-cal-go {{#if running}}is-on{{/if}}" data-action="toggleRun"><i class="fa-solid {{#if running}}fa-pause{{else}}fa-play{{/if}}"></i> {{#if running}}{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.PauseShort"}}{{else}}{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.RunShort"}}{{/if}}</a>
      <a data-action="toSunset"><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"></i> {{localize "VTM20.Calendar.ToSunset"}}</a>
      <a data-action="toSunrise"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"></i> {{localize "VTM20.Calendar.ToSunrise"}}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="r-cal-scene-row">
      {{#if hasScene}}<span><i class="fa-solid fa-stopwatch"></i> {{localize "VTM20.Calendar.SceneRunning"}} <b data-cal-scene>{{scene.text}}</b></span>
      {{else}}<span class="r-cal-muted"><i class="fa-solid fa-stopwatch"></i> {{localize "VTM20.Calendar.SceneNone"}}<span data-cal-scene hidden></span></span>{{/if}}
      <a data-action="sceneStart" data-tooltip="{{localize 'VTM20.Calendar.SceneHint'}}">{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.SceneStart"}}</a>
      <a data-action="announce" data-tooltip="{{localize 'VTM20.Calendar.Announce'}}"><i class="fa-solid fa-comment"></i></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  {{/if}}

  {{#if tabFlow}}
  <div class="r-cal-sec">
    <div class="r-cal-lbl">{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.SetDateTime"}}</div>
    <div class="r-cal-set">
      <input type="date" name="date" value="{{dateInput}}">
      <input type="time" name="time" value="{{timeInput}}">
      <button type="submit" class="r-cal-ok" title="{{localize 'VTM20.Common.Apply'}}"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="r-cal-sec">
    <div class="r-cal-lbl">{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Flow"}}
      <a class="r-cal-run {{#if running}}on{{/if}}" data-action="toggleRun" title="{{#if running}}{{localize 'VTM20.Calendar.Pause'}}{{else}}{{localize 'VTM20.Calendar.Run'}}{{/if}}">
        <i class="fa-solid {{#if running}}fa-pause{{else}}fa-play{{/if}}"></i>
        {{#if running}}{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Running"}}{{else}}{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Paused"}}{{/if}}
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="r-cal-adv r-cal-rates">
      <span>{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Speed"}}</span>
      {{#each rates as |x|}}<a class="{{#if x.on}}on{{/if}}" data-action="rate" data-rate="{{x.r}}" data-tooltip="{{localize 'VTM20.Calendar.SpeedHint'}}">{{x.label}}</a>{{/each}}
      <a class="r-cal-smooth {{#if smooth}}on{{/if}}" data-action="smooth" data-tooltip="{{localize 'VTM20.Calendar.SmoothHint'}}"><i class="fa-solid {{#if smooth}}fa-forward{{else}}fa-forward-fast{{/if}}"></i> {{#if smooth}}{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Smooth"}}{{else}}{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Jump"}}{{/if}}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="r-cal-adv">
      {{#each advances as |a|}}<a data-action="advance" data-ms="{{a.ms}}">{{a.label}}</a>{{/each}}
    </div>
    <div class="r-cal-adv r-cal-jumps">
      <a data-action="toSunset"><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"></i> {{localize "VTM20.Calendar.ToSunset"}}</a>
      <a data-action="toSunrise"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"></i> {{localize "VTM20.Calendar.ToSunrise"}}</a>
    </div>
    <p class="r-hint">{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.FlowHint"}}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="r-cal-sec r-cal-sec-last">
    <div class="r-cal-lbl">{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.SceneTimer"}}</div>
    {{#if hasScene}}
      <div class="r-cal-scene"><span>{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.SceneRunning"}}</span><b data-cal-scene>{{scene.text}}</b>
        <a data-action="sceneClear">{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Reset"}}</a></div>
    {{else}}
      <p class="r-hint"><i class="fa-solid fa-stopwatch"></i> {{localize "VTM20.Calendar.SceneHint"}}<span data-cal-scene hidden></span></p>
    {{/if}}
    <div class="r-cal-adv">
      <a data-action="sceneStart"><i class="fa-solid fa-stopwatch"></i> {{localize "VTM20.Calendar.SceneStart"}}</a>
      <a data-action="announce"><i class="fa-solid fa-comment"></i> {{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Announce"}}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  {{/if}}

  {{#if tabChron}}
  <div class="r-cal-sec r-cal-sec-last">
    <div class="r-cal-lbl">{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Chronicle"}}</div>
    <div class="r-cal-chron">
      <span>{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.ChronicleStart"}}: <b>{{chronicleStartLabel}}</b></span>
      <a data-action="chronicleHere" title="{{localize 'VTM20.Calendar.ChronicleHereHint'}}"><i class="fa-solid fa-flag"></i> {{localize "VTM20.Calendar.ChronicleHere"}}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="r-cal-set r-cal-lat">
      <label data-tooltip="{{localize 'VTM20.Settings.Latitude.Hint'}}">{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Lat"}}</label>
      <input type="number" name="latitude" value="{{latitude}}" step="0.01" min="-66" max="66">
      <label data-tooltip="{{localize 'VTM20.Settings.Longitude.Hint'}}">{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Lon"}}</label>
      <input type="number" name="longitude" value="{{longitude}}" step="0.01" min="-180" max="180">
      <label data-tooltip="{{localize 'VTM20.Settings.UtcOffset.Hint'}}">UTC</label>
      <input type="number" name="utcOffset" value="{{utcOffset}}" step="0.5" min="-12" max="14" class="r-cal-tz">
      <button type="submit" class="r-cal-ok" title="{{localize 'VTM20.Common.Apply'}}"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></button>
    </div>

    <div class="r-cal-lbl r-cal-lbl-gap">{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Upcoming"}}</div>
    <ul class="r-cal-events">{{#each events as |e|}}<li><i class="fa-solid {{e.icon}}"></i> <b>{{e.label}}</b> — {{e.when}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>

    <div class="r-cal-lbl r-cal-lbl-gap">{{localize "VTM20.Calendar.Journal"}}</div>
    <div class="r-cal-journal">
      {{#each journal as |j|}}
      <label class="r-cal-jr {{#if j.current}}is-now{{/if}}"><b>{{j.roman}}</b><small>{{j.date}}</small>
        <textarea data-night="{{j.n}}" rows="1" placeholder="{{localize 'VTM20.Calendar.NotePlaceholder'}}">{{j.text}}</textarea></label>
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
</div>
